      "mergeID": "65452cb78e6314c31fa55abc",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Open VRChat use an avatar that triggers the Temp Pose Space on off rapidly and after Time time it will start droping the frames.\n\nin the Live version was it fixed but on the last 2 Betas and now the Release Candidate its still in.",
