      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: With build 1374 the problem still exist.\n\nStarting with ~130fps and after 1 min im down to ~100 fps after 2 min im on ~75fps after 6 min im down to ~40fps and the game starts to lag heavily.\n\nstopping the temp Pose Space spam brings up the fps again to normal but as soon as it get activated the fps drops to the lowest Point.\n\nA reload of the Avatar in any way with like toggle OSC On/Off , Switching the Avatar or Activating Save Mode resets the FPS lose but will build up at the same speed as before.\n\nIts the same problem that got marked and fixed before on the live version but not in the Beta Build and with the push from the beta to Live with unity 2022 it was present on the Live server again.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1318-temporary-pose-space-loop-eventually-causing-lag",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
