  "details": "After new build the Temporary Pose Space causes lag again, fps is dropping more and more with time. The problem becomes significant when its a loop between two states that use Temporary Pose Space.\n\nYou can test it on this avatar (enable sword toggle and set speed to 100%, after some time you will see fps going down significantly) - avtr_dfffc07d-7dd2-42e6-bb10-92b81c4f2a97\n\nWhile this avatar was made for a specific world (Idle Home), Even in vrchat home with just myself it got me from 240 fps to 120 in just under a minute. In populated worlds it gets you to as low as 10 fps after some time.\n\nOn the previous build when it was fixed (1351) it was fine and there was no lag.",
